    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22903" root="شل" body-key="$">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">جَاؤُوا شِلَا لًا</span></b>  <i>They came driving away the
camels.</i> (S, O.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">ذَهَبَ القَوْمُ شِلَالًا</span> <i>The
people went driven away</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">اِنْشَلُّوا مَطْرُودِينَ</span>).
(TA.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b3-  And <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">شِلَالٌ</span> signifies <i>A company of men
in a scattered,</i> or <i>dispersed, state.</i> (S, O.)

